  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Refugee Helpline for Afghan Refugees in Pakistan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Refugee Helpline Project is to establish a dedicated protection helpline/information center in Islamabad for Afghan refugees and asylum seekers. This helpline will provide information, referrals, complaint handling, feedback mechanisms, protection monitoring, community outreach, data collection, and basic psychosocial support.\n</narrative>
  </description>
